{"unit_id":"Devin-AXIS__jev-dsh-decision#card-zh","repo":"Devin-AXIS/jev-dsh-decision","commit":"adc88caa9bf174d367e79a5f254c7936bcef088e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Jev DSH 决策引擎（DSH 插件，Agent Harness 工具与 Skill 接入）：为 Agent 提供结构化选择、评分与概率判断。它在 DSH 注册三个 Jev 工具和一个决策 Skill，并通过 iPolloWork 扩展服务复用同一决策核心。主要功能包括在候选工具、Skill 或 Agent 中选择，按标准评分，估计是非问题概率，检查本地凭据状态和测试 API 连接。适合希望让 Agent 获得明确决策结果、同时由原 Agent 继续规划和执行的场景。使用前需要 TypeSafe AI 账户和 TYPESAFE_API_KEY；评估上下文会发送到 TypeSafe AI。","source":"generated","evidence":["service/dsh.mjs:7-33","service/jev.mjs:142-150","service/work.mjs:3-10"]}
{"unit_id":"Devin-AXIS__jev-dsh-decision#card-en","repo":"Devin-AXIS/jev-dsh-decision","commit":"adc88caa9bf174d367e79a5f254c7936bcef088e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Jev DSH Decision Engine adds structured choices, scores, and yes or no probabilities to DSH. It registers three tools and a skill, also available in iPolloWork. Use it to select tools, skills, or agents. Requires a TypeSafe AI account and TYPESAFE_API_KEY; evaluation context goes to TypeSafe AI.","source":"generated","evidence":["service/dsh.mjs:7-33","service/jev.mjs:142-150","service/work.mjs:3-10"]}
