{"unit_id":"Devin-AXIS__jev-dsh-decision#feature-choice","repo":"Devin-AXIS/jev-dsh-decision","commit":"adc88caa9bf174d367e79a5f254c7936bcef088e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Jev DSH 决策引擎 的功能「候选项选择」：根据任务状态从用户提供的候选项中选出一项，并返回各候选概率与置信度。通过 jev_evaluate 工具提交 choice 问题及候选映射，得到结构化结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["service/jev.mjs:25-29","service/jev.mjs:61-68"]}
{"unit_id":"Devin-AXIS__jev-dsh-decision#feature-score","repo":"Devin-AXIS/jev-dsh-decision","commit":"adc88caa9bf174d367e79a5f254c7936bcef088e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Jev DSH 决策引擎 的功能「标准评分」：按用户提供的有序等级评价状态，并给出分数、各等级概率和置信度。通过 jev_evaluate 传入 score 类型问题及标准，分数按等级索引表示。","source":"generated","evidence":["service/jev.mjs:30-31","service/jev.mjs:61-72"]}
{"unit_id":"Devin-AXIS__jev-dsh-decision#feature-noul","repo":"Devin-AXIS/jev-dsh-decision","commit":"adc88caa9bf174d367e79a5f254c7936bcef088e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Jev DSH 决策引擎 的功能「是非概率评估」：估计一个明确条件为真的概率，结果是 0 到 1 的数值。通过 jev_evaluate 提交 noul 问题；也可为多个独立条件各提交一个问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["service/jev.mjs:32-33","service/jev.mjs:57-60"]}
{"unit_id":"Devin-AXIS__jev-dsh-decision#feature-check","repo":"Devin-AXIS/jev-dsh-decision","commit":"adc88caa9bf174d367e79a5f254c7936bcef088e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Jev DSH 决策引擎 的功能「配置与连接检查」：status 只查询本地凭据配置，check-connection 发送最小评估请求验证远端服务。用户可分别检查是否已配置和 API 是否实际可用；连接检查会产生请求用量。","source":"generated","evidence":["service/jev.mjs:145-149"]}
